    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t01-mother-05-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s05-t01-mother-05",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把乙原效率设为1，那么甲原效率是m。原先5天的工作量为5(m＋1)。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "提效后甲为1.5m，乙为n，同样工作量3天完成，所以5(m＋1)＝3(1.5m＋n)。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "整理5m＋5＝4.5m＋3n，得到m＝6n－10，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“提升50%”是乘1.5，“提升为n倍”是乘n，别把两种表述混用。"
        }
      ],
