    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t01-practice-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t01-practice-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26浙江事考）有一块草坪需要修剪。甲单独修剪，需15天完成；乙单独修剪，需30天完成；丙单独修剪，需12天完成。如果三人每人一天轮流修剪，最快多少天能完成？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "15"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "16"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "17"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "18"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
