    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t01-practice-05-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第5题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t01-practice-05",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26联考）某科技企业用a台智能机器人组装产品，原定20天完成。工作5天后，企业又增加了效率翻倍的b台新型机器人，最终提前4天完成。则a：b的范围是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "不足3"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3~5"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "5~7"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "超过7"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
